{"id":"legacy-recipe-3b2b038a-d096-4f7d-a405-001fb1493795","version":1,"category":"roof-outdoor","when":"Existing roof recipe; original compatible scales: family, luxury.","title":"Modern Tropical Ventilated Mono-Pitch Roof 01","combinations":"[{\"kind\":\"requires\",\"note\":\"cover primary living pavilion\",\"target\":\"main-house\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"extend low eave over outdoor seating\",\"target\":\"covered-terrace\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"direct visible downpipes and overflow away from entries\",\"target\":\"rain-garden\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"orient high clerestory edge toward pool and ocean views\",\"target\":\"pool\"},{\"kind\":\"conflicts\",\"note\":\"avoid low eaves over vehicle turning paths\",\"target\":\"driveway\"}]","placement":"Slope the roof away from prevailing ocean winds where site geometry allows. Lift the high edge toward the principal view without exposing occupied rooms to direct afternoon sun. Use a continuous ventilated ridge and insect-screened clerestory gap. Extend deep eaves over glazed walls and covered outdoor living zones. Collect roof runoff in concealed gutters and route overflow to planted drainage. Keep the roof silhouette as one disciplined plane with restrained structural expression.","principles":"Adapt approved guidance to the brief. Parameter options: [{\"key\":\"roofPitch\",\"max\":20,\"min\":5,\"unit\":\"deg\",\"value\":12},{\"key\":\"eaveDepth\",\"max\":3.5,\"min\":1.2,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":2.4},{\"key\":\"ridgeVentHeight\",\"max\":0.9,\"min\":0.2,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":0.45},{\"key\":\"roofProjectionLength\",\"max\":28,\"min\":7,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":14},{\"key\":\"clerestoryBandHeight\",\"max\":1.5,\"min\":0.35,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":0.8},{\"key\":\"rainwaterTankCapacity\",\"max\":30000,\"min\":3000,\"unit\":\"L\",\"value\":12000},{\"key\":\"roofFinish\",\"value\":\"standing-seam-metal\",\"options\":[\"standing-seam-metal\",\"light-toned-tile\",\"composite-shingle\"]},{\"key\":\"ceilingFinish\",\"value\":\"timber-soffit\",\"options\":[\"timber-soffit\",\"painted-fiber-cement\",\"bamboo-lining\"]}].","capabilities":"Required capabilities: . Check against the scene construction contract; approval does not implement capabilities.","construction":{"operations":["add","attach","place-on","finish"],"requiredKinds":["plate","wall","roof"],"materials":"Choose among ivory, limestone, timber, bronze and sage to suit the brief; no custom textures or specialist material certification.","supports":"Connect floors, enclosure, actual openings and overhead shelter as applicable; align supports and datums. Elevated decks need guards and actual access.","unsupported":"Required capabilities: . Check against the scene construction contract; approval does not implement capabilities. No automatic circulation, engineering, service equipment or code compliance verification."}}
{"id":"legacy-recipe-5ef674af-406c-465c-8608-4f8cbe8e46fc","version":1,"category":"climate-site","when":"Existing planting recipe; original compatible scales: family, luxury.","title":"Modern Tropical Garden Screen 01","combinations":"[{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"frame edges without blocking primary garden outlook\",\"target\":\"terrace\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"set back at least 1.5 m from coping\",\"target\":\"pool\"},{\"kind\":\"requires\",\"note\":\"provide concealed drip zones for layered planting\",\"target\":\"irrigation\"},{\"kind\":\"prefers\",\"note\":\"maintain a 1.2 m clear maintenance route\",\"target\":\"path\"},{\"kind\":\"conflicts\",\"note\":\"avoid placement within vehicle sight triangles\",\"target\":\"driveway\"}]","placement":"Layer tall palms and small-canopy trees behind dense broad-leaf understory. Create alternating planted masses and view gaps rather than a continuous hedge. Use salt-tolerant species on beach sites and windward exposures. Step planting with contours on hillside sites; do not create level soil banks. Place sculptural rock accents only at bed turns and focal view gaps. Conceal lighting within foliage and aim upward away from interior glazing. Keep planting clear of drainage lines, pool equipment, and emergency access.","principles":"Adapt approved guidance to the brief. Parameter options: [{\"key\":\"plantingBedDepth\",\"max\":5,\"min\":1.2,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":2.4},{\"key\":\"screenLength\",\"max\":30,\"min\":4,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":12},{\"key\":\"canopyPlantSpacing\",\"max\":5,\"min\":1.8,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":3},{\"key\":\"understoryPlantSpacing\",\"max\":1.5,\"min\":0.4,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":0.8},{\"key\":\"screenHeight\",\"max\":8,\"min\":2.5,\"unit\":\"m\",\"value\":4.5},{\"key\":\"openViewPercentage\",\"max\":60,\"min\":15,\"unit\":\"%\",\"value\":35},{\"key\":\"accentBoulderCount\",\"max\":10,\"min\":0,\"unit\":\"count\",\"value\":3},{\"key\":\"nightLighting\",\"unit\":\"string\",\"value\":